{
  "job_C16.5_20251003_115218": {
    "text": "Luna I qui natus fuerit, uitalis erit se \u00fee acenned bi\u00f0 liflic he bi\u00f0.\nLuna secunda, mediocris erit medeme he bi\u00f0.\nLuna tertia, infirmus erit untrum he bi\u00f0.\nLuna IIII, tractatus regnum erit trahtnere cyninga he bi\u00f0.\nLuna V, iuuenis tolletur geog he bi\u00f0 genumen.\nLuna sexta, uitalis erit liflic he bi\u00f0.\nLuna VII, uitalis et utilis erit liflic & notwur\u00f0e he bi\u00f0.\nLuna VIII iuuenis decidet geog he afealle\u00f0.\nLuna IX, omnium adquisitor erit ealra strinend he bi\u00f0.\nLuna X circuibit multa regiones he abuten f\u00e6r\u00f0 fela rica.\nLuna XI, omnium adquisitor erit ealra strinend he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XII, reliosus erit \u00e6wf\u00e6st he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XIII, aduersus impeditor erit wi\u00f0erweard letted he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XIIII, omnium tractator erit ealra trahtnere he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XV, iuuenis morietur geog swylt.\nLuna XVI, uitalis et pauper erit liflic & \u00feearfa he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XVIII, non diu uiuet na lange he ne leofa\u00f0.\nLuna XIX, in honore erit on wyr\u00f0scipe he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XX, bellator erit feohtere he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XXI, latro ingeniosus erit scea\u00fea \u00feancful he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XXII, laboriosus erit geswincful he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XXIII, uulgarus erit widcu\u00f0 he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XXIIII, copios erit genihtsum he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XXV, pericula multa patietur fr\u00e6cnyssa feala he \u00feola\u00f0.\nLuna XXVI, nec diues nec pauper erit na welig na w\u00e6dla he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XXVII, amicus erit freond he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XXVIII, neglegens erit gimeleas he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XXVIIII, bonus et prouisor erit god & forsceawere he bi\u00f0.\nLuna XXX, negotia multa tractabit ceapa feala he asmea\u00f0.",
